                                "sense_id": "c17a2e0b-2f70-36f2-8b3d-c2d39e886f2f",
                                "text": "So long as the African slave-trade lasted, the importation of slaves being presumably cheaper than breeding them, the industries run by slave labor were economically in much the same position as our own sweated trades […]"
